          "hebrew": "שַׁבַּ֨ת",
          "domain": "Sabbath"
        }
      ],
      "fluent": "It is a sabbath of complete rest for you, and you must deny yourselves. This is a lasting statute."
    },
    {
      "reference": "Leviticus 19:3",
      "source_reference": "Lev 19:3",
      "source_verse_sha256": "3fe149287d8df94a136f49a7caa6da58d818427d3942adcda4a6527fb2d050f5",
      "matches": [
        {
          "lemma": "7676",
          "hebrew": "שַׁבְּתֹתַ֖/י",
          "domain": "Sabbath"
        }
      ],
      "fluent": "Each of you must revere your mother and your father, and keep my sabbaths. I am the LORD your God."
    },
    {
      "reference": "Leviticus 19:30",
      "source_reference": "Lev 19:30",
      "source_verse_sha256": "bf93a7033c6d766ff602323c53127f2e8954042e2bba3920241d64b1be7a7c32",
      "matches": [
        {
          "lemma": "7676",
          "hebrew": "שַׁבְּתֹתַ֣/י",
          "domain": "Sabbath"
        }
      ],
      "fluent": "Keep my sabbaths and revere my sanctuary. I am the LORD."
    },
    {
      "reference": "Leviticus 23:3",
      "source_reference": "Lev 23:3",
      "source_verse_sha256": "14cf5e5543373a0278870f80686aa046f4ddd44572235eed307d92bfb78351ae",
      "matches": [
        {
          "lemma": "7676",
          "hebrew": "שַׁבַּ֤ת",
          "domain": "Sabbath"
        },
        {
          "lemma": "7676",
          "hebrew": "שַׁבָּ֥ת",
          "domain": "Sabbath"
        }
      ],
      "fluent": "You may work for six days. The seventh day is a Sabbath of complete rest, a sacred assembly. Do no work at all. It is a Sabbath to the LORD wherever you live."
    },
    {
      "reference": "Leviticus 23:11",
      "source_reference": "Lev 23:11",
      "source_verse_sha256": "45170adad1323a253d141ee31dcdbe5c3bf352f6fdd302432e7e0de4298896bb",
      "matches": [
        {
          "lemma": "d/7676",
          "hebrew": "הַ/שַּׁבָּ֔ת",
          "domain": "Sabbath"
        }
      ],
      "fluent": "The priest is to wave the sheaf before the LORD so it will be accepted on your behalf. He is to wave it on the day after the Sabbath."
    },
    {
      "reference": "Leviticus 23:15",
      "source_reference": "Lev 23:15",
      "source_verse_sha256": "ee26865023bc41b18678ac54f1c6633655cf35347933823287390754c96b02e6",
      "matches": [
        {
          "lemma": "d/7676",
          "hebrew": "הַ/שַּׁבָּ֔ת",
          "domain": "Sabbath"
        },
        {
          "lemma": "7676",
          "hebrew": "שַׁבָּת֖וֹת",
          "domain": "Sabbath"
        }
      ],
      "fluent": "Starting with the day after the Sabbath, the day you bring the sheaf as a wave offering, count seven Sabbaths. The count must cover seven full weeks."
    },
    {
      "reference": "Leviticus 23:16",
      "source_reference": "Lev 23:16",
      "source_verse_sha256": "4a67f0ef3045978145807e12f1e7438524d95278c1c5ca7610117a5883406b7b",
      "matches": [
        {
          "lemma": "d/7676",
          "hebrew": "הַ/שַּׁבָּת֙",
          "domain": "Sabbath"
        }
      ],
      "fluent": "Count fifty days, up to the day after the seventh Sabbath. Then bring the LORD an offering of new grain."
    },
    {
      "reference": "Leviticus 23:32",
      "source_reference": "Lev 23:32",
      "source_verse_sha256": "067d9bcb50cc34f47a62982b3488b329a22eca6be3e4b65e2d65d278ae5988b8",
      "matches": [
        {
          "lemma": "7676",
          "hebrew": "שַׁבַּ֨ת",
          "domain": "Sabbath"
        },
        {
          "lemma": "7676",
          "hebrew": "שַׁבַּתְּ/כֶֽם",
          "domain": "Sabbath"
        }
      ],
      "fluent": "It is a Sabbath of complete rest for you, and you must deny yourselves. Observe your Sabbath from the evening of the ninth day of the month until the next evening.”"
    },
    {
      "reference": "Leviticus 23:38",
      "source_reference": "Lev 23:38",
      "source_verse_sha256": "62fc7213596e53cd78fe4486b921721a12db7ab787e44cddcba616ac006171ec",
      "matches": [
        {
          "lemma": "7676",
          "hebrew": "שַׁבְּתֹ֣ת",
          "domain": "Sabbath"
        }
      ],
      "fluent": "These are in addition to the LORD’s Sabbaths, in addition to your gifts, in addition to all your vow offerings, and in addition to all your freewill offerings that you give the LORD."
    },
    {
      "reference": "Leviticus 24:8",
      "source_reference": "Lev 24:8",
      "source_verse_sha256": "ba1c532e68a02a9a5fe9cf967f444ff76421ce3ac5855b00665488279ea6feaf",
      "matches": [
        {
