          "hebrew": "הַ/שַּׁבָּ֗ת",
          "domain": "Sabbath"
        },
        {
          "lemma": "1285",
          "hebrew": "בְּרִ֥ית",
          "domain": "covenant"
        }
      ],
      "fluent": "Sabbath after Sabbath, Aaron is to arrange the bread before the LORD regularly. It comes from the Israelites as an everlasting covenant."
    },
    {
      "reference": "Leviticus 25:2",
      "source_reference": "Lev 25:2",
      "source_verse_sha256": "bbf64308c0e0e23cd15a34eaad074e2a735a2ee28b3b19416a036177e00c6119",
      "matches": [
        {
          "lemma": "7676",
          "hebrew": "שַׁבָּ֖ת",
          "domain": "Sabbath"
        }
      ],
      "fluent": "“Tell the Israelites: When you enter the land I am giving you, the land is to keep a Sabbath to the LORD."
    },
    {
      "reference": "Leviticus 25:4",
      "source_reference": "Lev 25:4",
      "source_verse_sha256": "216c70e373d1fc3ec6f71b8048bf56b3d7b542569d888c2348625cc72fb2fc57",
      "matches": [
        {
          "lemma": "7676",
          "hebrew": "שַׁבַּ֤ת",
          "domain": "Sabbath"
        },
        {
          "lemma": "7676",
          "hebrew": "שַׁבָּ֖ת",
          "domain": "Sabbath"
        }
      ],
      "fluent": "But in the seventh year, the land is to have a Sabbath of complete rest, a Sabbath to the LORD. Do not sow your field or prune your vineyard."
    },
    {
      "reference": "Leviticus 25:6",
      "source_reference": "Lev 25:6",
      "source_verse_sha256": "a32e80010962753e89f8bd0b58f6e4780645e55ef3e4f4cad05b404da3416d71",
      "matches": [
        {
          "lemma": "7676",
          "hebrew": "שַׁבַּ֨ת",
          "domain": "Sabbath"
        }
      ],
      "fluent": "Whatever the land grows during its Sabbath will be food for you, your male and female slaves, your hired worker and the residents staying with you."
    },
    {
      "reference": "Leviticus 25:8",
      "source_reference": "Lev 25:8",
      "source_verse_sha256": "a0f9e7b0283419a64e4f5c469b65b8bc375dadc2661994b94dddc4a981fb8837",
      "matches": [
        {
          "lemma": "7676",
          "hebrew": "שַׁבְּתֹ֣ת",
          "domain": "Sabbath"
        },
        {
          "lemma": "7676",
          "hebrew": "שַׁבְּתֹ֣ת",
          "domain": "Sabbath"
        }
      ],
      "fluent": "Count seven Sabbaths of years—seven times seven years—so the seven Sabbaths of years come to forty-nine years."
    },
    {
      "reference": "Leviticus 25:10",
      "source_reference": "Lev 25:10",
      "source_verse_sha256": "9874b7154cfa8beef6498fd39e7ea2a35e45d4312a5f251346d817537f318009",
      "matches": [
        {
          "lemma": "3104",
          "hebrew": "יוֹבֵ֥ל",
          "domain": "Jubilee"
        }
      ],
      "fluent": "Set the fiftieth year apart as holy and proclaim freedom throughout the land to everyone living in it. It will be a Jubilee for you. Each of you is to return to your family holding, and each of you to your family."
    },
    {
      "reference": "Leviticus 25:11",
      "source_reference": "Lev 25:11",
      "source_verse_sha256": "7a60901ca4581137e3e5ee215e2b16ac5d27af827855acb2e842e776bc3797dd",
      "matches": [
        {
          "lemma": "3104",
          "hebrew": "יוֹבֵ֣ל",
          "domain": "Jubilee"
        }
      ],
      "fluent": "The fiftieth year will be a Jubilee for you. Do not sow, reap what grows on its own or gather grapes from the untended vines."
    },
    {
      "reference": "Leviticus 25:12",
      "source_reference": "Lev 25:12",
      "source_verse_sha256": "7711e80126eec31fdddc9aa978b5d09e30069848fd4cc29b9bfc583f32a45938",
      "matches": [
        {
          "lemma": "3104",
          "hebrew": "יוֹבֵ֣ל",
          "domain": "Jubilee"
        }
      ],
      "fluent": "It is a Jubilee, holy to you. Eat what the fields produce."
    },
    {
      "reference": "Leviticus 25:13",
      "source_reference": "Lev 25:13",
      "source_verse_sha256": "0b5e4b3177c45c8bfb21c4491d7f264459f121c62eb8ec9867a9bc66e56885d8",
      "matches": [
        {
          "lemma": "d/3104",
          "hebrew": "הַ/יּוֹבֵ֖ל",
          "domain": "Jubilee"
        }
      ],
      "fluent": "In this Jubilee year, each of you is to return to your family holding."
    },
    {
      "reference": "Leviticus 25:15",
      "source_reference": "Lev 25:15",
      "source_verse_sha256": "7896e4ffd64df02e9f920f076ba45a70e089944bb0b758e5f2b1c4e70948259c",
      "matches": [
        {
          "lemma": "d/3104",
          "hebrew": "הַ/יּוֹבֵ֔ל",
          "domain": "Jubilee"
        }
      ],
      "fluent": "When you buy from your neighbor, base the price on the years since the Jubilee. He is to sell to you according to the number of harvest years left."
    },
    {
      "reference": "Leviticus 25:25",
      "source_reference": "Lev 25:25",
      "source_verse_sha256": "c8e18b8c72bd2ff4192c348a8f69d96ea04641874d74ad44ba9789f8922211b0",
      "matches": [
        {
          "lemma": "1350 a",
          "hebrew": "גֹֽאֲל/וֹ֙",
          "domain": "redeem"
        },
        {
          "lemma": "c/1350 a",
          "hebrew": "וְ/גָאַ֕ל",
          "domain": "redeem"
        }
      ],
      "fluent": "If your brother becomes poor and sells part of his family holding, his nearest redeemer is to come and redeem what his brother sold."
    },
    {
      "reference": "Leviticus 25:26",
      "source_reference": "Lev 25:26",
      "source_verse_sha256": "8a5acf1c3fbf042f5ad3b8809dbb6c2d9efdf34617237beb1f8ff125c43e7f38",
      "matches": [
        {
          "lemma": "1350 a",
          "hebrew": "גֹּאֵ֑ל",
          "domain": "redeem"
        }
      ],
      "fluent": "If he has no redeemer but later gains enough to redeem it himself,"
    },
    {
      "reference": "Leviticus 25:28",
      "source_reference": "Lev 25:28",
      "source_verse_sha256": "335e188bd5dba416106044d5755069eca9ec0d400d4f269ffdab6e8651f2b8b0",
      "matches": [
        {
          "lemma": "d/3104",
          "hebrew": "הַ/יּוֹבֵ֑ל",
          "domain": "Jubilee"
        },
        {
          "lemma": "b/3104",
          "hebrew": "בַּ/יֹּבֵ֔ל",
          "domain": "Jubilee"
        }
      ],
      "fluent": "If he cannot afford the refund, what he sold will remain with the buyer until the Jubilee year. At the Jubilee it will be released, and he may return to his family holding."
    },
    {
      "reference": "Leviticus 25:30",
      "source_reference": "Lev 25:30",
      "source_verse_sha256": "869462247c090f725d4223b2b23f8667a74f6846bd0047190e1f4bc7312e44ad",
      "matches": [
        {
          "lemma": "1350 a",
          "hebrew": "יִגָּאֵ֗ל",
          "domain": "redeem"
        },
        {
          "lemma": "b/3104",
          "hebrew": "בַּ/יֹּבֵֽל",
          "domain": "Jubilee"
        }
      ],
      "fluent": "If it is not redeemed before the full year ends, the house in that walled city becomes the buyer’s permanent property for his generations. It will not be released at the Jubilee."
    },
    {
      "reference": "Leviticus 25:31",
      "source_reference": "Lev 25:31",
      "source_verse_sha256": "c08958ac3b80b5e3093c0ded3914bbc45d0e2a65e15058f924a467d88a1370fa",
      "matches": [
        {
          "lemma": "c/b/3104",
          "hebrew": "וּ/בַ/יֹּבֵ֖ל",
          "domain": "Jubilee"
        }
      ],
      "fluent": "Houses in villages with no surrounding wall are to be treated like open fields. They may be redeemed, and they will be released at the Jubilee."
    },
    {
      "reference": "Leviticus 25:33",
      "source_reference": "Lev 25:33",
      "source_verse_sha256": "0772a045153c4adf54ddecf0ef9a862765861c408503ae38ce17d8bd0ff93547",
      "matches": [
        {
          "lemma": "1350 a",
          "hebrew": "יִגְאַל֙",
          "domain": "redeem"
        },
        {
          "lemma": "b/3104",
          "hebrew": "בַּ/יֹּבֵ֑ל",
          "domain": "Jubilee"
        }
      ],
      "fluent": "If someone redeems a house from the Levites, the house sold in the city they hold is to be released at the Jubilee. The houses in the Levites’ cities are their holding among the Israelites."
    },
    {
      "reference": "Leviticus 25:40",
      "source_reference": "Lev 25:40",
      "source_verse_sha256": "39135ca2c2da3e8d75e4850afbec1ec94819148cf8af16d5fbed87add0f11d6c",
      "matches": [
        {
          "lemma": "d/3104",
          "hebrew": "הַ/יֹּבֵ֖ל",
          "domain": "Jubilee"
        }
      ],
      "fluent": "Let him stay with you as a hired worker or resident. He is to work for you until the Jubilee year."
    },
    {
      "reference": "Leviticus 25:48",
      "source_reference": "Lev 25:48",
      "source_verse_sha256": "06e9b76e4152ec4c43f5a1b0fd5af1dff22f04c1c39e172a58df4f9d4a8ab109",
      "matches": [
        {
