          "hebrew": "יִגְאָלֶֽ/נּוּ",
          "domain": "redeem"
        }
      ],
      "fluent": "he retains the right to be redeemed after the sale. One of his brothers may redeem him."
    },
    {
      "reference": "Leviticus 25:49",
      "source_reference": "Lev 25:49",
      "source_verse_sha256": "1a5cdaad42de75540cbb580b0e8d9b8f374b94dafd777adc2cf20ea970c6969f",
      "matches": [
        {
          "lemma": "1350 a",
          "hebrew": "יִגְאָלֶ֔/נּוּ",
          "domain": "redeem"
        },
        {
          "lemma": "1350 a",
          "hebrew": "יִגְאָלֶ֑/נּוּ",
          "domain": "redeem"
        },
        {
          "lemma": "c/1350 a",
          "hebrew": "וְ/נִגְאָֽל",
          "domain": "redeem"
        }
      ],
      "fluent": "His uncle, his uncle’s son or another close relative from his family may redeem him. Or, if he gains the means, he may redeem himself."
    },
    {
      "reference": "Leviticus 25:50",
      "source_reference": "Lev 25:50",
      "source_verse_sha256": "b1e67a2c7b0eb5933e69b8aa98c080e954c6a450cfda0cdb428b5999abe38c97",
      "matches": [
        {
          "lemma": "d/3104",
          "hebrew": "הַ/יֹּבֵ֑ל",
          "domain": "Jubilee"
        }
      ],
      "fluent": "He and his buyer are to count the years from the year he was sold until the Jubilee year. His sale price is to be apportioned by the years, with his time valued like that of a hired worker."
    },
    {
      "reference": "Leviticus 25:52",
      "source_reference": "Lev 25:52",
      "source_verse_sha256": "e0fc0ce50ab8111a3e350d843ce307ce5eb5607d624da682e238ae99b2e15577",
      "matches": [
        {
          "lemma": "d/3104",
          "hebrew": "הַ/יֹּבֵ֖ל",
          "domain": "Jubilee"
        }
      ],
      "fluent": "If only a few years remain until the Jubilee, he is to count them with his buyer and pay for his redemption in proportion to those years."
    },
    {
      "reference": "Leviticus 25:54",
      "source_reference": "Lev 25:54",
      "source_verse_sha256": "06f8b2273770c31e3687376961d567598813e726781a468c07242775542f3da8",
      "matches": [
        {
          "lemma": "1350 a",
          "hebrew": "יִגָּאֵ֖ל",
          "domain": "redeem"
        },
        {
          "lemma": "d/3104",
          "hebrew": "הַ/יֹּבֵ֔ל",
          "domain": "Jubilee"
        }
      ],
      "fluent": "If he is not redeemed in any of these ways, he and his children are to be released in the Jubilee year."
    },
    {
      "reference": "Leviticus 26:2",
      "source_reference": "Lev 26:2",
      "source_verse_sha256": "db114d92fa246d5a16f25bc9d466c9f643eacbf3cfcd1d1ff800ff4485ad736b",
      "matches": [
        {
          "lemma": "7676",
          "hebrew": "שַׁבְּתֹתַ֣/י",
          "domain": "Sabbath"
        }
      ],
      "fluent": "Keep my Sabbaths and hold my sanctuary in reverence. I am the LORD."
    },
    {
      "reference": "Leviticus 26:9",
      "source_reference": "Lev 26:9",
      "source_verse_sha256": "c76e03f9374f6f487d8ed3431f3b0a75d220f8ed7019f0d21aa3a23f290872ec",
      "matches": [
        {
          "lemma": "1285",
          "hebrew": "בְּרִיתִ֖/י",
          "domain": "covenant"
        }
      ],
      "fluent": "I will turn toward you, make you fruitful and increase your numbers. I will uphold my covenant with you."
    },
    {
      "reference": "Leviticus 26:15",
      "source_reference": "Lev 26:15",
      "source_verse_sha256": "40cd85be5f51484b22ddecabab9ecdc716e21416435cfd8401772df274cbceb1",
      "matches": [
        {
          "lemma": "1285",
          "hebrew": "בְּרִיתִֽ/י",
          "domain": "covenant"
        }
      ],
      "fluent": "if you reject my statutes and abhor my ordinances, refusing to do all my commandments and breaking my covenant,"
    },
    {
      "reference": "Leviticus 26:25",
      "source_reference": "Lev 26:25",
      "source_verse_sha256": "416421e26493b42b18e54d7e7813f43412d5379879c956a8d5eb9cb597904195",
      "matches": [
        {
          "lemma": "1285",
          "hebrew": "בְּרִ֔ית",
          "domain": "covenant"
        }
      ],
      "fluent": "I will bring a sword against you to avenge the covenant. When you gather in your cities, I will send pestilence among you, and you will be handed over to an enemy."
    },
    {
      "reference": "Leviticus 26:34",
      "source_reference": "Lev 26:34",
      "source_verse_sha256": "710b85009d77356932fa41359be07f23fc49410a588d76294915d34fc8b5c866",
      "matches": [
        {
          "lemma": "7676",
          "hebrew": "שַׁבְּתֹתֶ֗י/הָ",
          "domain": "Sabbath"
        },
        {
          "lemma": "7676",
          "hebrew": "שַׁבְּתֹתֶֽי/הָ",
          "domain": "Sabbath"
        }
      ],
      "fluent": "Then the land will enjoy its Sabbaths throughout the time it lies desolate, while you are in your enemies’ land. Then the land will rest and enjoy its Sabbaths."
    },
